{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1991530496187105647","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-20T15:34:05.000Z","kind":"quote","text":"Still holding my $SPY short. I’ve got headroom to my stop and made the decision to play for a bigger move. The trade is now breakeven or better, so there’s no downside if I’m wrong. I don’t believe $NVDA’s earnings magically repaired the technical damage overnight\nThat said, December is typically the strongest month of the year, so we definitely don’t want to get married to a market short. But in this case, if I’m wrong, I lose nothing — and that’s how I make millions. 🤑\nIndividual stocks are what I'm really interested in. Currently, the list of buyable setups is scant. But that could change in short order. Patience and vigilance should be exercised.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1991530496187105647","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":"1984190748745503040","reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[{"type":"quoted","post_id":"1984190748745503040","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-10-31T09:28:33.000Z","text":"I shorted $SPY on Wednesday. The long-term trend remains up, but breadth is weakening — fewer stocks above their 50-day lines; a divergence that has been worsening for months. Rate cuts are priced in, and with the Fed hinting at a pause, a pullback looks likely."}],"entities":{"cashtags":["SPY"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["http://minervini.com"]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1991530496187105647"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1954,"reposts":175,"replies":121,"quotes":45,"views":469462,"bookmarks":287,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:19.515Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:19.515Z"}
