{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1991881584278974963","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-21T14:49:11.000Z","kind":"original","text":"To truly understand how I approach both trading and life, you should read all three of my books — including my mindset book, which is by far the most important. If you’ve read my second book and are wondering whether I consider fundamentals, the answer is yes. In fact, in my first book I go into fundamentals extensively.\nI consider my books a trilogy. For about $100, you’re getting my life’s work (all three) — decades of experience, research, and real-world application distilled into a complete framework. It’s one of the best risk/reward decisions you’ll ever make.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1991881584278974963","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["https://amazon.com/s?k=mark+minervini+books&crid=ZY1QAV9AP8EL&sprefix=mark+minervini%2Caps%2C130&ref=nb_sb_ss_ts-doa-p_2_14"]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1991881347401445376","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6SViDKW8AA-9hY.png","preview_url":"","width":783,"height":597,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1991881584278974963"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":806,"reposts":49,"replies":69,"quotes":9,"views":198169,"bookmarks":200,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1992067807094485240","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-22T03:09:10.000Z","kind":"original","text":"Lol! Who the f$%k are \"they.\"  These types of traders are hysterical. Mission control is on to us!  The fix is in!! Omg! 🤣 How about there are more sellers than buyers? 🤔","text_source":"text","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1992067807094485240","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_1992067555280756736","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6U-4xkXIAAGcx-.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1080,"height":984,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["1992067559638839360","1992067807094485240"],"is_earliest":false},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1391,"reposts":53,"replies":182,"quotes":16,"views":169950,"bookmarks":74,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"}
