{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1992342743306367234","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-22T21:21:40.000Z","kind":"original","text":"Wrong!  You could have 10 people that want to sell and only one person that wants to buy (or any combination, including none). Furthermore, the ten people that want to sell could have many more shares to sell than the one person who wants to buy is willing to buy. In that case, the Market Maker or Specialist would be the \"buyer.\" However, they only have to honor a hundred shares at any one price level, so the price would drop precipitously. Hence, more sellers than buyers. This is not opinion, it's fact.  Those of you arguing this, should stop making idiots out of yourselves. You are clueless on how an auction market works.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1992342743306367234","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1992342743306367234"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":874,"reposts":50,"replies":55,"quotes":9,"views":162492,"bookmarks":235,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1992357194445291568","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-22T22:19:06.000Z","kind":"original","text":"The more I hear people debate supply and demand, the clearer it becomes why so few traders ever get super rich. Most are arguing theories and personal opinions  instead of understanding reality.","text_source":"text","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1992357194445291568","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1992357194445291568"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1473,"reposts":83,"replies":71,"quotes":19,"views":157337,"bookmarks":142,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:09.512Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1992955392825925915","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-24T13:56:07.000Z","kind":"original","text":"For every excuse you make, I can find a thousand people who succeeded with less than you and under far more difficult circumstances. I'm one of them.\nYour excuses are neither unique nor definitive. And the challenges you’re facing right now? They're valuable gifts. When you learn to embrace them — to say “thank you, teacher” — you stop complaining about the past and worrying about the future and you start learning. That’s when you begin to understand what winners already know:\nAll excuses are just excuses.\nWe all have them. The difference is how we use them. Some people let excuses define and discourage them, and that's why they never succeed... because you will always have excuses; reasons for not trying, not committing, or quitting.\nWinners use challenges as opportunities to learn. They live in gratitude on the bad days, not just when it's convenient. That’s the mindset that separates those who rise from those who stay stuck.\nI believe in you because you are me, and we are all of us. There is nothing more powerful than a human who has made up his mind to learn and persist unconditionally.\nNow get your ass to work — and expect some setbacks along the way. But go confidently in the direction of your dreams, stay committed, and never give up.\nLove and blessing for health, wealth and happiness.\n😇🙏👊🤑❤️","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1992955392825925915","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1992955392825925915"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":2144,"reposts":178,"replies":107,"quotes":23,"views":161737,"bookmarks":524,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1994141571751850213","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:34.000Z","kind":"original","text":"Thanksgiving is a great time to remind ourselves of the things we’re truly grateful for. Real happiness comes from perspective—comparing ourselves not to those who have more, but to those who have less. There will always be someone above you and someone below you; you’ll never stay at the top forever, and you won’t remain at the bottom forever either.\n\nWhat truly matters is how you view your situation, what you choose to do with where you are right now, and how you feel about the journey. Gratitude turns what you have into enough, and gives you the humility and purpose to strive for more without losing sight of what's important.\nHappy Holiday.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1994141571751850213","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1994140677333254218","1994141571751850213"],"is_earliest":false},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1154,"reposts":65,"replies":62,"quotes":5,"views":84155,"bookmarks":72,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1994418752746606845","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-28T14:50:59.000Z","kind":"original","text":"The only way to master love is to practice love. You don't need to justify love. You don't need to explain love. You just need to practice it. Practice creates mastery, because love is never wrong. Love what you do. Love life. Love being loved and giving love.\nHave a great day! 😇🙏👊😎","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1994418752746606845","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1994418752746606845"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":981,"reposts":51,"replies":68,"quotes":5,"views":88070,"bookmarks":96,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"}
