{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1994858009395351959","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-29T19:56:26.000Z","kind":"quote","text":"I have to say, some people here on Twitter (I still call it Twitter) are seriously comical. I shorted the $SPY on October 29, the day of the high. The trade attained a quick 6R profit without ever putting me at a loss. I then made the decision to play the trade for a bigger move and moved my stop to break even. That means I either loss nothing, or make a bigger profit.  Suddenly, some people are saying I got \"bagged\" on the trade. Lol!  Not only has the price not hit my stop loss, but it hasn't even come back to my break even level. Shows many of you have a lot to learn about trading, and certainly a lot to learn about me.\nBest wishes.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1994858009395351959","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":"1984190748745503040","reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[{"type":"quoted","post_id":"1984190748745503040","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-10-31T09:28:33.000Z","text":"I shorted $SPY on Wednesday. The long-term trend remains up, but breadth is weakening — fewer stocks above their 50-day lines; a divergence that has been worsening for months. Rate cuts are priced in, and with the Fed hinting at a pause, a pullback looks likely."}],"entities":{"cashtags":["SPY"],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1994858009395351959"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1958,"reposts":85,"replies":176,"quotes":13,"views":364023,"bookmarks":226,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:48:04.051Z"}
{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"1995145771419644223","user_id":"105353526","handle":"markminervini","created_at":"2025-11-30T14:59:54.000Z","kind":"quote","text":"How about fun.  Entertainment. The human need to interact???  What does it matter?  We go into business to make money, and it's that very incentive that creates, innovates, and improve our lives. And even those of us who don't need money may still go into business with money not the front end goal, but simply a back end bi product of providing something useful. Enjoy it. Use it. Don't judge it.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"1995145771419644223","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":"1994942420845564100","reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[{"type":"quoted","post_id":"1994942420845564100","handle":"mindlesstrades","created_at":"2025-11-30T01:31:52.000Z","text":"We are all here posting because of either money or ego"}],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[],"edit":{"history_ids":["1995145771419644223"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":448,"reposts":15,"replies":32,"quotes":0,"views":116088,"bookmarks":15,"observed_at":"2026-11-27T11:47:27.224Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-27T11:47:27.224Z"}
